{{Passive skill box|War Bringer}}

'''War Bringer''' is a notable [[Ascendancy passive skill]] for the [[Berserker]]. It doubles the number of [[exert]]ed attacks granted by [[warcry|warcries]].

==Ruthless mode==
{{infocard
|header    = War Bringer (Ruthless)
|subheader = Ascendancy Notable Passive Skill
|1         = <div class="passive-icon-container passive-icon-type__ascendancy_notable"><div class="passive-icon-frame"></div>[[File:WarBringer (Berserker) passive skill icon.png]]</div>
|2         = Warcries Exert twice as many Attacks
}}

War Bringer in [[Ruthless mode]] is unchanged.

==Version history==
{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.25.0|
* The War Bringer Ascendancy Passive Skill no longer provides "Warcries grant 10 Rage per 5 power if you have less than 25 Rage", "Warcries Sacrifice 10 Rage if you have at least 25 Rage", or "Exerted Attacks deal 50% more Attack Damage if a Warcry Sacrificed Rage Recently". It now provides "Warcries Exert twice as many Attacks".
}}
{{Version history table row|3.11.0|
* War Bringer has been redesigned. It now causes Warcries to grant 10 Rage per 5 Power if you have less than 25 Rage, and causes them to sacrifice 10 Rage if you have at least 25 Rage. It also causes Exerted Attacks to deal 50% more Damage if a Warcry sacrificed Rage recently.
*Old mods listed below:
** {{c|mod|Recover 25% of Life and Mana when you use a Warcry}}
** {{c|mod|100% increased Warcry Cooldown Recovery Speed}}
** {{c|mod|100% increased Warcry Duration}}
** {{c|mod|If you've Warcried Recently, you and nearby allies have 20% increased Attack Speed}}
** {{c|mod|15% chance to deal Double Damage if you've Warcried in the past 8 seconds}}
}}
{{Version history table row|3.8.0|
* Now grants you and nearby allies 20% increased attack speed if you've warcried recently (from 10%). Now grants 15% chance to deal double damage if you've warcried in the past 8 seconds. No longer causes you and nearby allies to deal increased damage if you've warcried recently.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.7.0|
* No longer causes you to gain 5 rage when you use a warcry. Instead now grants you and nearby allies 10% increased attack speed and 30% increased damage if you've used a warcry recently.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.2.0|
* Added {{c|mod|Gain 5 Rage when you use a Warcry}}.
}}
{{Version history table row|2.3.0|
* Life and Mana recovery from using a Warcry increased from 10% to 25%.
* Added {{c|mod|100% increased Warcry duration}}.
}}
{{Version history table row|2.2.0|
* Added to the game.
}}
{{Version history table end}}
